  "solution": {
    "text": "Here, $\\mathrm{b}^2-4 \\mathrm{ac}=1^2-4 \\times \\sqrt{5} \\times \\sqrt{5}$ $=1-20=-19$<br />Therefore, the solutions are<br />$\\frac{-1 \\pm \\sqrt{-19}}{2 \\sqrt{5}}=\\frac{-1 \\pm \\sqrt{19 i}}{2 \\sqrt{5}}$",
